{"version":1,"content":"<p>型男沈震軒與黃浩然在音樂劇輪演同角，挑戰連唱17首歌的獨腳戲！</p><p>談及初戀情節，人夫黃浩然急展「求生欲」撇清前度。</p><p>面對影視寒冬，他們強調演員必需主動求變，曾兼職網約車司機的沈震軒直言：「唔變係因為驚。</p><p>」兩人更不約而同透露有意挑戰幕後做編劇！</p><p>&amp;l</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:20:28.897783+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:01:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:13:37.254673+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:13:37.254673+00:00","content_hash":"e34d45038fb70528efd941cbce8d605ada01a17985d2f2049f42349b1d128bd6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}